      "Kit by era: Gretsch in Genesis, Premier and Pearl, Gretsch again from 1983; concert toms; check against interviews.",
      "Read the 1979 Modern Drummer feature (paywalled) for his own words.",
      "What Collins meant by 'There's no kick in between the last two tom hits' (quoted by Drumeo), when Drumeo's notation beside it has the kick on the 'e' of 4 between two floor-tom pairs."
    ]
